WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:09.000
Wie blickst du seit dem 7. Oktober auf Europa und den zunehmenden Antisemitismus?

00:11.666 --> 00:13.300
We see what is going on around the world,

00:13.300 --> 00:17.366
and it is scary. And today,

00:17.366 --> 00:20.266
I trust the UAE and Bahrain.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.733
Far more than I trust Spain

00:23.733 --> 00:27.566
or Italy or France.

00:28.666 --> 00:33.600
I think that Germany

00:35.033 --> 00:38.566
has done a very smart move after the Holocaust:

00:38.833 --> 00:42.700
Germany took responsibility and accountability.

00:42.866 --> 00:44.433
And that's what you don’t see many,

00:44.433 --> 00:45.666
many other people do.

00:45.666 --> 00:48.166
Not just about the Holocaust in general.

00:48.200 --> 00:49.633
You speak about the Turks,

00:49.633 --> 00:50.666
what they're doing to the Kurds,

00:50.666 --> 00:54.066
Everyone around the world

00:54.066 --> 00:56.600
is having a hard time taking responsibility,

00:56.600 --> 00:57.600
and accountability.

00:58.666 --> 01:00.233
Germany did not.

01:00.233 --> 01:03.633
Germany took accountability for what has happened

01:03.633 --> 01:09.166
and made sure that it indoctrinated their children,

01:10.066 --> 01:11.500
to understand,

01:12.233 --> 01:14.333
history and what has happened.

01:14.666 --> 01:16.800
I think that today,

01:16.800 --> 01:20.000
Germany is seeing the fruit of that because

01:20.000 --> 01:25.033
I think that Germany is far more,

01:26.000 --> 01:34.233
cautious about going against

01:34.233 --> 01:35.933
the Jews without having

01:35.933 --> 01:39.233
reasons or things that they know for sure,

01:39.233 --> 01:42.433
that are not stupid empty propaganda.

01:42.433 --> 01:46.100
I think that the Germans, with their indoctrination

01:46.100 --> 01:48.100
throughout the years after the Holocaust,

01:48.233 --> 01:50.633
have done a lot in order to keep themselves,

01:50.900 --> 01:54.700
to keep them their critical thinking alive.

01:55.733 --> 01:57.466
And I think

01:57.466 --> 02:00.300
that's a very big difference

02:01.266 --> 02:02.533
between the countries.

02:02.533 --> 02:04.033
It’s not stable, firstly,

02:04.033 --> 02:05.533
we’re talking about politics,

02:05.733 --> 02:07.566
and we’re talking about politicians.

02:07.566 --> 02:09.066
Let's not forget that.

02:09.600 --> 02:12.933
The second thing is that still,

02:13.633 --> 02:16.500
if you compare it to what is happening in other countries,

02:16.833 --> 02:19.100
you do have that,

02:19.100 --> 02:22.400
but you also have a very strong other side,

02:22.400 --> 02:25.833
you also have people that are strongly defending

02:25.833 --> 02:27.766
the idea of

02:27.766 --> 02:30.533
be cooperating with Israel and all that.

02:30.800 --> 02:35.000
So I think that you still have that balance,

02:35.766 --> 02:39.733
I don’t think that Germany needs to go after Israel

02:39.733 --> 02:41.800
"whatever happens"

02:41.966 --> 02:43.533
We’re talking about critical thinking,

02:43.533 --> 02:48.100
I know what people see around the world today can make them...

02:48.100 --> 02:50.133
I see the news,

02:50.133 --> 02:54.166
what is reported, the news are very biased,

02:54.166 --> 02:56.933
most of the channels are extremely biased.

02:57.533 --> 03:05.333
So I think that it’s a political

03:05.366 --> 03:10.533
and a media kind of thing.

03:10.533 --> 03:15.033
Politicians are trying to get more support.

03:15.333 --> 03:16.200
But still,

03:16.200 --> 03:19.633
I wouldn’t even compare the situation in Germany,

03:19.633 --> 03:22.133
or Austria for example,

03:22.433 --> 03:24.933
to the situation in France and Italy

03:24.933 --> 03:26.666
and Spain.

03:27.366 --> 03:32.100
It’s way, way different.

03:32.100 --> 03:35.400
it’s just now that I think about it,

03:35.400 --> 03:37.700
but I think it all starts from accountability,

03:37.966 --> 03:38.566
because again,

03:38.566 --> 03:41.033
Australia is the one that also took accountability,

03:41.200 --> 03:42.500
of the things

03:42.500 --> 03:43.933
after the Holocaust.

03:43.933 --> 03:45.866
I think it has a lot to do with that.

03:49.133 --> 03:52.066
Every time that as a Jew, I travel around Europe,

03:52.333 --> 03:54.666
every country I come to, they tell me:

03:54.700 --> 03:56.900
"Oh we were not with the Nazis",

03:56.900 --> 03:58.933
"but they, they were with the Nazis".

03:59.133 --> 04:01.066
And as I walk through I go like

04:01.400 --> 04:03.200
"What the fuck nobody was with the Nazis",

04:03.200 --> 04:05.866
but somehow they became so big

04:06.133 --> 04:08.700
but nobody went with them,

04:08.700 --> 04:11.400
so I think that many countries just

04:11.800 --> 04:14.333
don’t take accountability and

04:17.233 --> 04:19.600
There are some countries that I will not go to,

04:20.300 --> 04:23.800
because it just seems not safe.

04:23.800 --> 04:25.000
In general

04:25.000 --> 04:27.000
there are a lot of things going on today,

04:27.000 --> 04:29.833
look at Paris, look at who wants to travel there?

04:29.833 --> 04:31.266
you want to travel, you want to have fun,

04:31.266 --> 04:33.700
you don’t want to get into this,

04:34.466 --> 04:37.300
and many European countries are not fun to travel today.

04:37.300 --> 04:39.200
That's one reason.

04:40.866 --> 04:44.700
I will not stop myself from going somewhere

04:45.933 --> 04:49.100
because a), terrorists don’t make my schedule,

04:50.000 --> 04:51.300
and b),

04:51.300 --> 04:54.200
I've lived here for 20 years.

04:54.466 --> 04:57.766
I'm not scared of them. I survived a massacre.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.466
I'm not scared of them.

04:59.566 --> 05:01.900
They can all fuck off, I don’t give a fuck really.

05:01.900 --> 05:06.333
Sorry for my language but seriously,

05:10.833 --> 05:15.000
If I didn’t believe that I will die when I need to,

05:15.000 --> 05:16.900
I wouldn’t be able to live here.

05:17.633 --> 05:20.600
You need to have a certain

05:22.100 --> 05:23.800
way of looking at life,

05:24.366 --> 05:27.100
in order to not jump when this is heard.

05:27.100 --> 05:29.133
You need to have a certain...

05:30.833 --> 05:32.566
So, no it wouldn’t stop me.

05:32.566 --> 05:34.466
I wouldn’t go because it doesn’t look fun,

05:34.466 --> 05:37.200
but if I needed to go or wanted to go,

05:37.200 --> 05:38.500
it wouldn’t stop me,

05:39.200 --> 05:40.166
I believe.
